---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Market data

The contents of data/btcusdt_1s/ are derived from Binance public market data
(https://data.binance.vision) and remain subject to Binance's terms of use.
They are redistributed here, re-encoded into a compact binary form, solely to
make this research project reproducible offline.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE. This software is a forecasting experiment. It has no
execution, slippage, fee or risk model, and nothing in it constitutes a
recommendation to trade any asset.
